Description: panvk/jm: run indirect draw helpers in a separate job chain
 Index min/max searches and indirect draw helpers ran inside the
 vertex/tiler chain. Move them and the polygon heap reset into a chain
 submitted before it, and patch all draws of a batch with one compute job.
Author: pocket-debs
Origin: https://github.com/masterxq/mesa-lisbon (branch lisbon/26.3)
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-25
